        "src/tools/preview.ts reads those pins and invokes `npx -y @agent8/gameserver-node@<pin>` and `npx -y @agent8/deploy@<pin>`. Fallback: when a pin is missing, falls back to `npx -y @agent8/<pkg>` (today's behavior) so partial package.json isn't a breaking change.",
        "Env override VERSE8_GAMESERVER_BUILD_PIN='<pkg>=<ver>,<pkg>=<ver>' parses into per-package overrides (takes precedence over package.json).",
