        "scripts/prepublish-guard.sh runs `npm pack --dry-run --json`, enumerates every file in the tarball, and greps each for: `glpat-[A-Za-z0-9_-]+`, `.verse8/token`, `VITE_AGENT8_ACCOUNT=0x`, `Bearer [A-Za-z]`, `\"access_token\":\"`, `.map$`. Exit 1 with a file:line diagnostic on any hit.",
        "Script exits 0 on a clean tarball and exits 1 on a tarball containing any of the above secret shapes.",
        "tests/unit/prepublishGuard.test.mjs has ≥4 cases: (a) clean tree passes, (b) planted glpat-* in dist/ fails, (c) planted .env token value passes (because .env is not in `files`), (d) planted .map file fails. Each case uses `npm pack --dry-run --json` + runs the guard script against the resulting file list (the test can mock `npm pack --dry-run` output if invoking it is too slow; prefer direct invocation if <5s).",
